# promise: #828
# ChatGPT in the Command Bar off (Arc's default): "chatg" offers no ChatGPT scope, a question gets no "Ask ChatGPT" row,
# and ⌥⌘G opens the plain ⌘T bar, as Arc 1.174 did with the switch off (27 Nov 2026, GitHub #828).
budget rss=700 stalls50=20
seed settings.json {"hasSeenImportPrompt": true, "toolbarDefaultMigrated": true, "searchSuggestions": false}
pace 0.5
cra://open?url=${PAGE}?n=gpt-off
wait 2
cra://commandbar?query=chatg
wait 1
cra://debug?commandBarScope=offered-off
expect-log command bar scope offered-off: none, .* hint -
cra://commandbar?query=what%20is%20two%20plus%20two
wait 1
cra://debug?commandBarRows=plain-off
expect-log Cra command bar rows plain-off: open=1
reject-log rows plain-off:.*chatgpt\.com/\?q=
cra://dismiss
wait 1
cra://action/newChatGPTMessage
wait 1
cra://debug?commandBarScope=gpt-off
expect-log command bar scope gpt-off: none, .* placeholder Search or Enter URL…
cra://dismiss
